== Abstract ==

This document specifies an opt-in signature-hash algorithm for Bitcoin transactions.
A signature opts in by setting bit <code>0x20</code> in its hash-type byte.
From the BLAKE2b activation height, such signatures sign a common message format across bare, P2SH, segwit v0, taproot key-path, and tapscript spends.

For those signatures it removes the quadratic hashing of CVE-2013-2292 and the missing amount commitment of CVE-2020-14199.
It does not bound worst-case validation cost, since a transaction that does not opt in still hashes quadratically.

